                <description>&lt;img src="https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/cover.png" alt="Featured image of post 【PS】斜纹镂空艺术字实现方式" /&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&#34;alert alert-note&#34;&gt;















    &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;玩《明日方舟：终末地》，发现它们挺常用斜纹镂空字体当背景，而且还挺好看的，于是想用PhotoShop复刻一下同款字体
&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B0%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2204&#34;
	height=&#34;724&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B0%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93_hu_8c26bc716f24d67a.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E7%BB%88%E6%9C%AB%E5%9C%B0%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93_hu_2201d0f50cea4cc3.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;304&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;730px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-斜纹制作可选&#34;&gt;1. 斜纹制作（可选）
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（1）PS新建空白画布&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（2）选择&lt;strong&gt;直线工具&lt;/strong&gt;，按住键盘&lt;kbd&gt;shift&lt;/kbd&gt;，水平绘画一条直线&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;438&#34;
	height=&#34;384&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2_hu_b1784002ad9b8bdb.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C2_hu_ffc17665cb630a56.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;114&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;273px&#34;
	
&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C3.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2040&#34;
	height=&#34;1204&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C3_hu_d68a799e90e98dd0.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C3_hu_d70ac85ab1ae1cb9.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;169&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;406px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（3）键盘&lt;kbd&gt;crtl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;j&lt;/kbd&gt;复制图层，并调整&lt;strong&gt;属性&lt;/strong&gt;中的&lt;strong&gt;Y&lt;/strong&gt;值，调整条纹的间隔&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C4.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2040&#34;
	height=&#34;1204&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C4_hu_4b1a2f3afd5f5ee6.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C4_hu_262c2823677b4619.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;169&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;406px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（4）键盘&lt;kbd&gt;crtl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;shift&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;alt&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;t&lt;/kbd&gt;，等距离复制直线&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C5.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2040&#34;
	height=&#34;1204&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C5_hu_628939d913b850da.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C5_hu_a537f1f36538ffb.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;169&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;406px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;（5）合并两装图层，并&lt;strong&gt;属性&lt;/strong&gt;调整角度-45度&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C6.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2040&#34;
	height=&#34;1204&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C6_hu_d512bd0f368f2a7d.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C6_hu_e996aa99a6fb6f71.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;169&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;406px&#34;
	
&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C7.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2040&#34;
	height=&#34;1204&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C7_hu_7a2dc2818be0f39e.png 480w, https://letere-gzj.github.io/hugo-stack/p/ps/striped-perforated-font/make/%E6%96%9C%E7%BA%B9%E5%88%B6%E4%BD%9C7_hu_129e98cbe1872a55.png 1024w&#34;
